<section class="faq">
    <h2 class="faq__header">
        FAQ
    </h2>
    <div class="faq__questions">
        <div class="questions__column">
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        What services do you provide?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    The Profi Dental Medical Center offers a full range of
                    dental services:<br>
                    ● therapeutic dental treatment;<br>
                    ● endodontic treatment of canals under an
                    operating microscope, removal of broken
                    instruments;<br>
                    ● surgical treatment, including implantation
                    according to the All-on-4 / All-on-6 protocol;<br>
                    ● orthodontic treatment of occlusion and TMJ
                    pathologies;<br>
                    ● orthodontic treatment using various types of
                    bracket systems and aligners;<br>
                    ● orthopedic treatment (veneers, prosthetics,
                    crowns, onlays);<br>
                    ● professional hygiene and prevention;<br>
                    ● periodontal treatment;<br>
                    ● pediatric dentistry.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        Is the treatment painful?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    We use modern methods of anesthesia, which
                    makes the treatment as comfortable and painless as
                    possible. For patients with a high level of anxiety,
                    sedation under the supervision of a specialist is
                    possible.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        How can I make an appointment?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    You can make an appointment in a way convenient
                    for you: <br><br>
                    ● by phone; <br>
                    ● via the clinic's website; <br>
                    ● via social networks (Facebook, Instagram).
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        Is it possible to pay in installments?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    Yes, at the Profi Dental clinic, payment in
                    installments is available through installments at
                    PrivatBank.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        How often do I need a preventive
                        examination?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    The frequency of preventive examinations depends
                    on the condition of the dentofacial system and the
                    treatment performed. Recommendations of the
                    Profi Dental clinic: <br><br>
                    ● Adult patients - examination 2 times a year. <br>
                    ● Children - examination every 3 months, since in
                    childhood the processes of development and
                    change of teeth occur faster. <br>
                    ● Patients with orthopedic structures (crowns,
                    veneers) - examination at least 2-3 times a year to
                    monitor the condition of restorations and
                    periodontal tissues. <br>
                    ● Patients with implants - examination every 4-6
                    months to check the integration of implants and the
                    condition of the gums. <br>
                    ● Patients with periodontal problems - an individual
                    program, but on average every 3-4 months. <br><br>
                    Regular examinations allow you to timely detect complications, maintain the results of treatment
                    and maintain a high level of oral hygiene.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="questions__column">
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        Do you have a service guarantee?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    Yes, the Profi Dental clinic provides a guarantee for
                    all types of dental services, provided that the patient
                    undergoes timely preventive examinations and
                    follows all medical recommendations.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        What bracket systems do you use?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    The clinic applies an individual approach to each
                    patient. We work with different types of braces: <br><br>
                    ● Ligature and self-ligating; <br>
                    ● Ceramic and metal; <br>
                    ● Also possible treatment with aligners.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        How long does a visit to the dentist last?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    The duration of the visit depends on the complexity
                    of the treatment. For example, the treatment of
                    caries lasts an average of 1.5-2 hours. The exact
                    duration of each visit is determined by the doctor
                    after a consultation.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="question">
                <button class="question__header">
                    <img src="images/svgs/plus.svg">
                    <p>
                        Can I get an X-ray or CT scan done on
                        site?
                    </p>
                </button>
                <p class="question__answer">
                    Yes, the clinic performs all necessary X-ray
                    examinations: <br><br>
                    ● computed tomography (CT) of the jaws; <br>
                    ● orthopantomography (panoramic image); <br>
                    ● targeted X-rays of the teeth; <br>
                    ● teleradiography (TRG) (lateral, direct projection,
                    wrist); <br>
                    ● CT of the joints.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

